+Spec {
  // Marks the `link` meta on the same slot as a loop cut.  A cut link
  // adds no edge to the execute sort, and its push is delivered at the end
  // of the execute cycle, so the slot reads the previous cycle's value in
  // any order.  A slot that declares its own `link` is cut only if it also
  // declares `loopCut`.  A link instance carries it as a `loopCut` tag.
  // See [hx.doc.haxall::Comps#execution].
  loopCut: Marker?
}

